  "description": "A minimal, embeddable Visual FoxPro 9 stored-procedure interpreter: a tree-walking interpreter for real VFP9 .prg source (PROCEDURE/FUNCTION definitions, control flow, VFP dynamic scoping (LOCAL/PRIVATE/PUBLIC), by-value/by-reference parameter passing, ON ERROR/AERROR error handling) running against a live CrossVault.FoxDbf VfpSession - so .prg code that opens tables, seeks, scans, and writes records operates on the same byte-compatible, Rushmore-optimized engine as the rest of CrossVault.FoxDbf. For running real-world VFP9 business-logic stored procedures on .NET without a Visual FoxPro installation.",
